1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,120
Man: Listen to an announcement on the campus radio station.

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,655
Good morning, senior class. Starting next semester,

3
00:00:08,655 --> 00:00:15,220
all graduating students must complete a professional development workshop before receiving their diplomas.

4
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:20,714
This requirement ensures you are equipped with essential career skills,

5
00:00:20,714 --> 00:00:25,110
including resume writing, interview preparation, and networking strategies.

6
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:28,220
Sessions will be available throughout the semester

7
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:32,189
but they may fill up fast, so plan ahead and sign up early.

8
00:00:32,189 --> 00:00:37,150
Check the university website for details on scheduling and registration.

9
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:42,040
Your future success starts with preparation.
